<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - Northeastern Illinois University.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - Northeastern Illinois University.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>John Nuveen &amp; Co Inc said it received the written award for the $4.505 million of Northeastern Illinois University Board of Trustees, university facilities system revenue bonds, Series 1997 with a top yield of 5.75 percent in 2017.</p>
